OL,3,GNEWSASearch for developer to transform
OL,4,ABroad Marsh site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA search for a lead developer for the
OL,7,FBroad Marsh site in Nottingham has been
OL,8,Flaunched.
OL,10,FGovernment housing agency Homes England
OL,11,Fbought the site in 2025 and wants a
OL,12,Fpartner to help create a major city
OL,13,Fcentre neighbourhood which could
OL,14,Finclude about 1,000 homes.
OL,16,FPlans also include up to 20,000 sq m
OL,17,F(215,000 sq ft) of shops, offices and
OL,18,Fcommunity spaces, with up to 2,000 jobs
OL,19,Fexpected to be created.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
