OL,3,GNEWSASearch for developer to transform
OL,4,ABroad Marsh site
OL,5,
OL,6,FJo Nugent, executive regional director
OL,7,Ffor the Midlands at Homes England, said
OL,8,Fthe organisation wants to "work with
OL,9,Fambitious, experienced partners" who
OL,10,F"share our commitment to creating a
OL,11,Fvibrant, sustainable new quarter that
OL,12,FNottingham can be proud of".
